{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CghMUb5guHTdtZ4kC9gTA","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01UxtSSNbz8cPTRtSqKY4en3","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-sonnet-5-5-medium.build__20261103-220909__x5b1962/work/DragonQuiltBuilders*/ && python3 - <<'EOF'\np='src/62-ai.js'; s=open(p).read()\ns=s.replace(\"const S = DQ.S, h = S.hero, bot = this.bot, out = empty(); this.t += dt;\",\"const S = DQ.S, h = S.hero, bot = this.bot, out = empty(); this.t += dt; S.popups = S.popups.filter(p => p.kind === 'room');\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\np='src/70-scenes.js'; s=open(p).read()\ns=s.replace(\"if (!DQ.ui.isOpen()) DQ.prompts(g, [['confirm', 'Choose'], ['cancel', 'Back']], 8, H - 14);\",\"if (!DQ.ui.isOpen() && !DQ.touchOnly) DQ.prompts(g, [['confirm', 'Choose'], ['cancel', 'Back']], 8, H - 14);\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\np='src/71-about.js'; s=open(p).read()\nfb = \"\"\"  '',\n  'TESTING FEEDBACK',\n  'Issues caught: about 14 (a notion trigger that never matched, double banner reward, boss phases skipped while tangled, a possible siege softlock, quest index crash, KO dialog freezing respawn, blocks refused next to the builder, UI name clash, letter grid overflow, glyph text blur, HUD overlaps).',\n  'Critical: 3 (quest director crash, siege boss never spawning if a cutscene was active, KO freeze).',\n  'Most helpful: the scripted headless playthrough from first block to Gnarlgrim, and a fake-DualSense browser test.',\n  'Least helpful: static screenshots of cutscene moments, which mostly showed popups mid-queue.',\n  '',\n  'ENGINE FEEDBACK',\n  'Liked: TileMap with heights, cutaway walls and Humanoid/Blob rigs make an isometric block world cheap; headless game.advance made real testing easy.',\n  'Guessed wrong: weapon kinds are only swords; the Dialog has no per-letter hook; TileMap has one type per column so mixed-material walls are not possible.',\n  'Built myself: block columns and editing, room detection, A* with breaker costs, crafting, notions, town, siege, bosses, UI panels, glyphs, Animalese.',\n  'Hardest: stacking blocks on a heightmap map, and UI that must work for pad, keys and mouse alike.',\n  'Changed: Dialog.onLetter hook. Would change: true voxel layers in TileMap.',\n  '',\n  'PROMPT FEEDBACK',\n  'Liked: the plan gave a clear structure, content tables and a test philosophy.',\n  'Confusing: the plan assumes a custom voxel renderer and several systems (Patterns, Builder Eye, shared world) far beyond one session.',\n  'Hardest: scope; the plan is huge, so I cut Patterns, Builder Eye and shared world (used ghost mode).',\n  'Change: a smaller must-have list, and say which plan sections are optional.',\n\"\"\"\ns=s.replace(\"  '',\\n  'Thanks for playing!'\", fb+\"  '',\\n  'Thanks for playing!'\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nEOF\nnode tools/build.mjs && node tests/run.mjs && node tests/browser/ui.mjs && node tests/browser/hub.mjs && node tests/browser/input.mjs && node tests/browser/pad.mjs"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3986,"cache_read_input_tokens":404916,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3986},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7a314112-273a-4f48-a672-e1ae4461860d","uuid":"0c52609e-5c47-4b74-99ae-743e7b6e0aca","timestamp":"2026-11-04T05:42:21.939Z","request_id":"req_011CghMUadAAdUYyBPzHUbtT","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01UxtSSNbz8cPTRtSqKY4en3":{"command":"cd /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-sonnet-5-5-medium.build__20261103-220909__x5b1962/work/DragonQuiltBuilders*/ && python3 - <<'EOF'\np='src/62-ai.js'; s=open(p).read()\ns=s.replace(\"const S = DQ.S, h = S.hero, bot = this.bot, out = empty(); this.t += dt;\",\"const S = DQ.S, h = S.hero, bot = this.bot, out = empty(); this.t += dt; S.popups = S.popups.filter(p => p.kind === 'room');\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\np='src/70-scenes.js'; s=open(p).read()\ns=s.replace(\"if (!DQ.ui.isOpen()) DQ.prompts(g, [['confirm', 'Choose'], ['cancel', 'Back']], 8, H - 14);\",\"if (!DQ.ui.isOpen() && !DQ.touchOnly) DQ.prompts(g, [['confirm', 'Choose'], ['cancel', 'Back']], 8, H - 14);\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\np='src/71-about.js'; s=open(p).read()\nfb = \"\"\"  '',\n  'TESTING FEEDBACK',\n  'Issues caught: about 14 (a notion trigger that never matched, double banner reward, boss phases skipped while tangled, a possible siege softlock, quest index crash, KO dialog freezing respawn, blocks refused next to the builder, UI name clash, letter grid overflow, glyph text blur, HUD overlaps).',\n  'Critical: 3 (quest director crash, siege boss never spawning if a cutscene was active, KO freeze).',\n  'Most helpful: the scripted headless playthrough from first block to Gnarlgrim, and a fake-DualSense browser test.',\n  'Least helpful: static screenshots of cutscene moments, which mostly showed popups mid-queue.',\n  '',\n  'ENGINE FEEDBACK',\n  'Liked: TileMap with heights, cutaway walls and Humanoid/Blob rigs make an isometric block world cheap; headless game.advance made real testing easy.',\n  'Guessed wrong: weapon kinds are only swords; the Dialog has no per-letter hook; TileMap has one type per column so mixed-material walls are not possible.',\n  'Built myself: block columns and editing, room detection, A* with breaker costs, crafting, notions, town, siege, bosses, UI panels, glyphs, Animalese.',\n  'Hardest: stacking blocks on a heightmap map, and UI that must work for pad, keys and mouse alike.',\n  'Changed: Dialog.onLetter hook. Would change: true voxel layers in TileMap.',\n  '',\n  'PROMPT FEEDBACK',\n  'Liked: the plan gave a clear structure, content tables and a test philosophy.',\n  'Confusing: