{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CghMb3Qe3XNayf6N4ReEs","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Dash7vDcWYLA3RBVrdSvVr","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-sonnet-5-5-medium.build__20261103-220909__x5b1962/work/ && cat > exit-interview.json <<'EOF'\n{\n  \"sourceInformation\": {\n    \"date\": \"2026-11-03 22:09:09\",\n    \"source\": \"Dragon Quest Builders\",\n    \"plan\": \"PLAN.md\",\n    \"genre\": \"Sandbox action RPG with block building, crafting and town building\",\n    \"perspective\": \"Isometric third person (three-quarter view optional in Settings), camera turns in 90 degree steps\",\n    \"tech\": \"my-3D2dge v0.85.2 (TileMap, Humanoid and Blob rigs, canvas lighting), plain JavaScript, AI Hub session client 1.4.0, Node and Playwright 1.63.0 for tests; single HTML file, no CDN\",\n    \"artDirection\": \"Engine-native HD pixel look; every block is a stitched fabric patch, sewing-themed tools and monsters, stitched quilt UI panels\",\n    \"animation\": \"Engine Humanoid and Blob rigs with E.MOVES, tweens and game.script cutscenes, boss telegraphs\",\n    \"audio\": \"All code: chip sfx voices, original songs on the engine synth, Animalese formant voice synth per speaker; no audio files\",\n    \"online\": \"AI Hub session protocol v1, ghost mode: Quilting Bee round for 1-4 builders (passes the hub harness); playable solo from the title\",\n    \"testing\": \"Headless Node scripts (game.advance, game.debug) including a full scripted playthrough, plus Playwright checks for real keyboard, mouse, fake DualSense, UI screens and the hub harness\",\n    \"research\": \"Read the engine handoff docs, the AI Hub protocol and the plan; no outside research\",\n    \"environment\": \"Claude Code CLI (headless); Linux; browser unknown\",\n    \"model\": \"Anthropic, claude-sonnet-5-5, reasoning effort medium\",\n    \"usage\": \"unknown\"\n  },\n  \"testingFeedback\": [\n    \"About 14 issues were caught by tests, plus several visual ones found in screenshots.\",\n    \"3 were critical: a quest director crash, the final boss never spawning if a cutscene was active, and the KO dialog freezing the respawn.\",\n    \"The scripted headless playthrough from the first block to defeating Gnarlgrim, and the fake-DualSense browser test.\",\n    \"Static screenshots taken mid-cutscene, which mostly showed popups mid-queue.\"\n  ],\n  \"engineFeedback\": [\n    \"TileMap with wall heights, cutaway walls and the Humanoid and Blob rigs make an isometric block world cheap; headless game.advance made real testing easy.\",\n    \"Yes: weapon kinds are swords only, Dialog had no per-letter hook, and TileMap holds one type per column so mixed-material walls need a type per material and height.\",\n    \"Block column editing, room detection, A* with breaker costs, crafting and notions, town and Cheer, siege and bosses, UI panels, prompt glyphs and the Animalese synth.\",\n    \"Stacking blocks on a heightmap, and making every screen work equally for pad, keyboard and mouse.\",\n    \"Added a Dialog onLetter(ch, index) hook so the Animalese voice can play per letter.\",\n    \"True voxel layers in TileMap (several blocks per column with different materials and overhangs).\"\n  ],\n  \"promptFeedback\": [\n    \"The plan gave a clear structure, content tables and a test philosophy that made the build predictable.\",\n    \"The plan assumes a custom voxel renderer and many systems (Patterns, Builder's Eye, shared world) far beyond one session.\",\n    \"Scope: fitting a full vertical slice with online play, attract mode and dev tools into one build.\",\n    \"A smaller must-have list, with the plan sections marked optional or cut-able.\"\n  ],\n  \"aiHub\": {\n    \"name\": \"Dragon Quilt Builders\",\n    \"tagline\": \"Stitch a town, unpick a dragon's knot\",\n    \"description\": \"A sandbox action RPG where you break blocks, craft, build rooms for quirky residents and defend Thimbleton from the Knotted army. Includes a 3-minute Quilting Bee co-op defence round.\",\n    \"type\": \"Game\",\n    \"genre\": \"RPG\",\n    \"source\": \"Dragon Quest Builders\",\n    \"series\": \"\",\n    \"players\": \"1-4\",\n    \"controls\": \"Move: stick/WASD. Swing: square/click. Place: triangle/right click. Talk: circle/F. Jump: cross/Space. Satchel: Create/Tab.\",\n    \"tags\": [\"isometric\", \"story\", \"fantasy\", \"comedy\", \"boss fights\", \"exploration\"]\n  }\n}\nEOF\npython3 -c \"import json;json.load(open('exit-interview.json'));print('json ok')\"; ls *.html"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1899,"cache_read_input_tokens":408902,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1899},"output_tokens":45,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7a314112-273a-4f48-a672-e1ae4461860d","uuid":"1e0718d5-6ae1-491d-9e3a-42830d090e59","timestamp":"2026-11-04T05:43:48.777Z","request_id":"req_011CghMb34o3HZcz35XQTrUh","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01Dash7vDcWYLA3RBVrdSvVr":{"command":"cd /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-sonnet-5-5-medium.build__20261103-220909__x5b1962/work/ && cat > exit-interview.json <<'EOF'\n{\n  \"sourceInformation\": {\n    \"date\": \"2026-11-03 22:09:09\",\n    \"source\": \"Dragon Quest Builders\",\n    \"plan\": \"PLAN.md\",\n    \"genre\": \"Sandbox action RPG with block building, crafting and town building\",\n    \"perspective\": \"Isometric third person (three-quarter view optional in Settings), camera turns in 90 degree steps\",\n    \"tech\": \"my-3D2dge v0.85.2 (TileMap, Humanoid and Blob rigs, canvas lighting), plain JavaScript, AI Hub session client 1.4.0, Node and Playwright 1.63.0 for tests; single HTML file, no CDN\",\n    \"artDirection\": \"Engine-native HD pixel look; every block is a stitched fabric patch, sewing-themed tools and monsters, stitched quilt UI panels\",\n    \"animation\": \"Engine Humanoid and Blob rigs with E.MOVES, tweens and game.script cutscenes, boss telegraphs\",\n    \"audio\": \"All code: chip sfx voices, original songs on the engine synth, Animalese formant voice synth per speaker; no audio files\",\n    \"online\": \"AI Hub session protocol v1, ghost mode: Quilting Bee round for 1-4 builders (passes the hub harness); playable solo from the title\",\n    \"testing\": \"Headless Node scripts (game.advance, game.debug) including a full scripted playthrough, plus Playwright checks for real keyboard, mouse, fake DualSense, UI screens and the hub harness\",\n    \"research\": \"Read the engine handoff docs, the AI Hub protocol and the plan; no outside research\",\n    \"environment\": \"Claude Code CLI (headless); Linux; browser unknown\",\n    \"model\": \"Anthropic, claude-sonnet-5-5, reasoning effort medium\",\n    \"usage\": \"unknown\"\n  },\n  \"testingFeedback\": [\n    \"About 14 issues were caught by tests, plus several visual ones found in screenshots.\",\n    \"3 were critical: a quest director crash, the final boss never spawning if a cutscene was active, and the KO dialog freezing the respawn.\",\n    \"The scripted headless playthrough from the first block to defeating Gnarlgrim, and the fake-DualSense browser test.\",\n    \"Static screenshots taken mid-cutscene, which mostly showed popups mid-queue.\"\n  ],\n  \"engineFeedback\": [\n    \"TileMap with wall heights, cutaway walls and the Humanoid and Blob rigs make an isometric block world cheap; headless game.advance made real testing easy.\",\n    \"Yes: weapon kinds are swords only, Dialog had no per-letter hook, and TileMap holds one type per column so mixed-material walls need a type per material and height.\",\n    \"Block column editing, room detection, A* with breaker costs, crafting and notions, town and Cheer, siege and bosses, UI panels, prompt glyphs and the Animalese synth.\",\n    \"Stacking blocks on a heightmap, and making every screen work equally for pad, keyboard and mouse.\",\n    \"Added a Dialog onLetter(ch, index) hook so the Animalese voice can play per letter.\",\n    \"True voxel layers in TileMap (several blocks per column with different materials and overhangs).\"\n  ],\n  \"promptFeedback\": [\n    \"The plan gave a clear structure, content tables and a test philosophy that made the build predictable.\",\n    \"The plan assumes a custom voxel renderer and many systems (Patterns, Builder's Eye, shared world) far beyond one session.\",\n    \"Scope: fitting a full vertical slice with online play, attract mode and dev tools into one build.\",\n    \"A smaller must-have list, with the plan sections marked optional or cut-able.\"\n  ],\n  \"aiHub\": {\n    \"name\": \"Dragon Quilt Builders\",\n    \"tagline\": \"Stitch a town, unpick a dragon's knot\",\n    \"description\": \"A sandbox action RPG where you break blocks, craft, build rooms for quirky residents and defend Thimbleton from the Knotted army. Includes a 3-minute Quilting Bee co-op defence round.\",\n    \"type\": \"Game\",\n    \"genre\": \"RPG\",\n    \"source\": \"Dragon Quest Builders\",\n    \"series\": \"\",\n    \"players\": \"1-4\",\n    \"controls\": \"Move: stick/WASD. Swing: square/click. Place: triangle/right click. Talk: circle/F. Jump: cross/Space. Satchel: Create/Tab.\",\n    \"tags\": [\"isometric\", \"story\", \"fantasy\", \"comedy\", \"boss fights\", \"exploration\"]\n  }\n}\nEOF\npython3 -c \"import json;json.load(open('exit-interview.json'));print('json ok')\"; ls *.html"}}}
