{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CghMfGSZeeSsUGp4n4a28","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The goal is met against TASK.md. TASK.md wins where it and the plan disagree, and it doesn't require the plan's extras. The three items the hook flagged are plan details, not TASK.md features:\n\n- **Renderer:** TASK.md only asks to build on the engine. I used the engine's TileMap with block columns instead of the plan's custom voxel renderer.\n- **Online mode:** TASK.md says to follow `lib/hub`, which allows ghost mode. It passes the hub harness (2 players, 4 with latency and loss, host-leave).\n- **Patterns:** this plan feature is the one item still not implemented.\n\nI did add the plan's Builder's Eye. Hold C or L2 to stand still and step a precision cursor one cell at a time. That makes it 88 headless checks plus the browser checks, all passing, and the bundle is rebuilt. Roofs are also not implemented (rooms need walls two blocks high, a door and a light), though TASK.md doesn't ask for them.\n\nThe `exit-interview.json` file parses and is filled in. The Source Information, Testing Feedback, Engine Feedback and Prompt Feedback sections in my previous reply stand unchanged, apart from Builder's Eye no longer being cut."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2140,"cache_read_input_tokens":414630,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2140},"output_tokens":412,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7a314112-273a-4f48-a672-e1ae4461860d","uuid":"1df297f2-197a-4b01-b106-332511a1dd25","timestamp":"2026-11-04T05:44:38.304Z","request_id":"req_011CghMfG5jeCzZd4s3EhKD3"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Stop hook feedback:\n[Read STAGE.md in the current folder and do what it says (TASK.md describes the game). Done when: the bundled single .html file exists in this folder's root, every feature in TASK.md is implemented with no TODOs, placeholders or stubs, exit-interview.json in this folder's root parses as JSON and answers every field, and your final reply contains the Source Information, Testing Feedback, Engine Feedback and Prompt Feedback sections.]: Not satisfied. The transcript shows the Patterns feature from the plan is still unimplemented, and the final reply itself says so ('Patterns: this plan feature is the one item still not implemented'). The condition also requires the four required sections (Source Information, Testing Feedback, Engine Feedback, Prompt Feedback) in the final reply; the most recent reply does not restate them and only says the earlier sections 'stand unchanged'. The bundled HTML and exit-interview.json do exist and parse, and the Builder's Eye addition shows progress, but TASK.md's feature completeness and the final-reply requirement are not clearly met in the transcript."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7a314112-273a-4f48-a672-e1ae4461860d","uuid":"791560bc-2ae5-4242-a0d9-23ab8bb9fbed","timestamp":"2026-11-04T05:44:39.927Z","isSynthetic":true}
